    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Doggy Wash Express is a 100% self-service dog washing station in Nice, on avenue Saint-Barthélémy. The postcode varies between directories (06100 or 06000): the number and the avenue are enough to get there. It runs on an automated terminal with card payment, with no staff on site.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The station offers shampoo, conditioner, anti-parasite treatment, and a choice of gentle or strong drying, with products certified by veterinary labs and lukewarm water for the dog's comfort. The station is open 7 days a week from 8am to 8pm. The company was registered on 8 November 2024. A phone number is associated with the station: 06 27 01 75 05. Prices are not published online.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: a very recent station (registered in late 2024) — check the most recent reviews before going, as the equipment and upkeep may still be evolving.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Saint-Barthélémy neighbourhood, in the north of Nice, is close to the roads leading into the Nice hinterland.</p>
